00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.310 line:78%
THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION'S ARMED

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:11.845 line:78%
CRACKDOWN ON ITS CRITICS.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.714 line:78%
EARLIER THIS MONTH, A LONGTIME

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:16.583 line:78%
FBI AGENT AND SWAT TEAM VETERAN

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:20.253 line:78%
CALLED STEVE FRIEND CAME FORWARD

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.689 line:78%
TO BLOW THE WHISTLE.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:25.125 line:78%
WHAT HE SAID WASK SHOWING.

