ACCORDING TO AGENT FRIEND,

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:28.762 line:78%
BIDEN'S FBI USES HEAVILY-ARMED

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.063 line:78%
SWAT TEAMS TO RAID THE HOMES OF

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.897 line:78%
AMERICAN CITIZENS WHO DARE TO

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.499 line:78%
CRITICIZE THE ADMINISTRATION.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:34.634 line:78%
TO BE CLEAR, THESE ARE PEOPLE

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.802 line:78%
