00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.237 line:78%
THESE ARE PEOPLE WHO HAVEN'T

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:40.774 line:78%
BEEN CONFUSED, MUCH LESS

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:42.108 line:78%
CONVICTED, OF A VIOLENT CRIME.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.878 line:78%
THE POINT IS NOT TO BRING

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.612 line:78%
JUSTICE, BUT TO TERRIFY JOE

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.113 line:78%
BIDEN'S POLITICAL OPPONENTS.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.481 line:78%
HARD TO BELIEVE IT'S HAPPENING,

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.949 line:78%
BUT IT IS.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.683 line:78%
LAST YEAR, THE FBI'S

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:54.721 line:78%
COUNTERTERRORISM DIVISION RAIDED

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:56.089 line:78%
THE HOME OF A 69-YEAR-OLD RED

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.424 line:78%
CROSS VOLUNTEER.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:01:01.828 line:78%
AN ANONYMOUS SNITCH HAD CLAIMED

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:02.228 line:78%
THAT HE WAS AT THE CAPITOL ON

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.196 line:78%
JANUARY 6th.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.731 line:78%
NOT THAT HE DID ANYTHING

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.999 line:78%
VIOLENT, BUT HE WAS THERE.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.400 line:78%
IT WAS A LIE.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:09.002 line:78%
THE FEDS MOVED FORWARD AND

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.703 line:78%
DESTROYED HIS LIFE ANYWAY.

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.838 line:78%
THEY SHOWED UP WITH GUNS, STOLE

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.073 line:78%
HIS ELECTRONIC DEVICES, AND

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:16.076 line:78%
REFUSED TO RETURN THEM.

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:18.178 line:78%
THE WHOLE EXPERIENCE WAS SO

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:18.912 line:78%
TRAUMATIC THAT HE SUFFERED TWO

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.213 line:78%
STROKES.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:22.382 line:78%
WELL, ON SEPTEMBER 19th, THE

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:25.051 line:78%
FBI SUSPENDED AGENT STEVE FRIEND

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:27.020 line:78%
FOR DARING TO REVEAL WHAT WAS

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.721 line:78%
HAPPENING, THESE ABUSES.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.722 line:78%
IT'S ILLEGAL, UNDER FEDERAL LAW,

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:31.291 line:78%
TO PUNISH WHISTLEBLOWERS, BUT

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.325 line:78%
THE FBI DID IT ANYWAY.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.793 line:78%
THEN FOUR DAYS LATER, WITH

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.562 line:78%
FRIEND OUT OF THE WAY, ON THE

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:42.802 line:78%
MORNING OF SEPTEMBER 23rd, A

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:46.139 line:78%
TEAM OF NEARLY 30 FBI AGENTS,

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:49.776 line:78%
BRISTLES WITH AUTOMATIC WEAPONS,

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:50.176 line:78%
CAME INTO THE HOME OF ANOTHER

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.846 line:78%
MAN.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.279 line:78%
HE'S A LEADER IN HIS LOCAL

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.348 line:78%
COMMUNITY.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:56.249 line:78%
THEY POINTED WEAPONS IN FRONT OF

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.818 line:78%
THEIR SEVEN CHILDREN.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:02:01.054 line:78%
TO BE HERE, HE'S NOT A

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.421 line:78%
TERRORIST, NEVER BEEN ACCUSED OF

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:04.757 line:78%
TERRORISM.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:07.894 line:78%
HE'S INSTEAD A PRO-LIFER.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:10.096 line:78%
HE FOUNDED AN ORGANIZATION

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:11.064 line:78%
ENCOURAGING MEN TO BE LEADERS IN

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.732 line:78%
THEIR COMMUNITIES.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.567 line:78%
HERE HE IS DESCRIBING THE

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:16.202 line:78%
EXPERIENCE HE HAD EARLIER THIS

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:17.370 line:78%
YEAR, PRAYING OUTSIDE AN

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:22.108 line:78%
ABORTION CLINIC WITH HIS SON.

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:23.076 line:78%
&gt;&gt; A WOMAN CAME OUT WHO HAD AN

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.378 line:78%
ABORTION.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:26.713 line:78%
WE OFFERED HER POSTABORTION

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.281 line:78%
HEALING.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.681 line:78%
WE JUST SAID WE'LL PRAY FOR

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.285 line:78%
YOU.

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:35.021 line:78%
AS WE WERE PRAYING, I BROUGHT MY

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:39.259 line:78%
SON OVER, I SAID, COME ON, LET'S

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:43.263 line:78%
KNEEL DO THIS.

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:44.831 line:78%
WE'LL DO THIS AND LEAVE.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:50.970 line:78%
SHE ATTACK US.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:52.472 line:78%
I SAID, SON, THIS IS WHAT THE

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.840 line:78%
LORD SAID.

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:55.275 line:78%
THEY PERSECUTED ME.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:03:03.516 line:78%
THEY'LL PERSECUTE ME.

00:02:55.408 --> 00:03:04.050 line:78%
SHE WAS SPEWING VULGARITY ON TO

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.186 line:78%
HIM AND ME.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.554 line:78%
THIS IS PART OF THE JOURNEY.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.689 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT'S MARK HAUCK.

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:11.558 line:78%
HE'S A RELIGIOUS MAN.

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:13.159 line:78%
NOT EVERYONE AGREES WITH HIM,

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:14.994 line:78%
BUT THERE'S NO DOUBT THAT HE'S A

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.563 line:78%
PEACEFUL, A NONVIOLENT PERSON.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.997 line:78%
IN OCTOBER OF LAST YEAR, HAUCK

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.432 line:78%
WAS STANDING OUTSIDE ANOTHER

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.000 line:78%
ABORTION CLINIC IN PENNSYLVANIA,

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.401 line:78%
JOINED AGAIN BY HIS 12-YEAR-OLD

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:25.071 line:78%
SON.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:26.306 line:78%
THAT'S WHEN A MAN APPROACHED

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:27.941 line:78%
HIM, BEGAN HARASSING THE BOY.

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.608 line:78%
TO DEFEND HIS SON, HAUCK

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.176 line:78%
PUNISHED THE EXTREMIST BACK.

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:31.544 line:78%
THAT WAS IT.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:33.112 line:78%
LOCAL POLICE LOOKED INTO IT.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:34.047 line:78%
THE DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S OFFICE

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.515 line:78%
LOOKED INTO IT.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:37.083 line:78%
NOBODY PRESSED CHARGE AGAINST

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:38.885 line:78%
MARK HAUCK, BECAUSE IT'S NOT

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:40.853 line:78%
ASSAULT TO PROTECT YOUR SON FROM

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:41.588 line:78%
AN EXTREMIST WHO'S ATTACKING

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:43.189 line:78%
HIM.

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:45.959 line:78%
BUT THE BIDEN JUSTICE DEPARTMENT

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:47.760 line:78%
DECIDED TO REVISE THIS VIEW, AND

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:49.729 line:78%
THEY CHARGED MARK HAUCK WITH A

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.430 line:78%
FEDERAL CRIME, A FELONY,

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:52.465 line:78%
OBSTRUCTING ABORTION ACCESS.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.766 line:78%
THERE WAS IN EVIDENCE THAT HE

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:56.135 line:78%
HAD OBSTRUCTED ABORTION ACCESS,

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:56.502 line:78%
BUT THAT'S WHAT THEY CHARGED HIM

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.071 line:78%
WITH.

00:03:56.603 --> 00:04:00.006 line:78%
HAUCK LEARNED ABOUT THREE MONTHS

00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:02.308 line:78%
AGO THAT THE DOJ PLANNED TO

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:03.576 line:78%
CHARGE HIM, AND HE OFFERED TO

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.678 line:78%
TURN HIMSELF IN VOLUNTARILY.

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.079 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT A CIVILIZED COUNTRY

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:08.748 line:78%
ALLOWS.

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:10.583 line:78%
THAT WASN'T GOOD ENOUGH FOR

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:12.252 line:78%
MERRICK GARLAND'S DOJ, THEY

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:15.088 line:78%
WANTED TO PUNISH HIM, AND

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:16.456 line:78%
TERRIFY HIS FAMILY, TO SEND A

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:18.258 line:78%
MESSAGE TO ANYONE THAT WOULD

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:20.827 line:78%
DARE TO GET IN THE WAY OF

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:23.229 line:78%
BIDEN'S AGENDA.

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:24.530 line:78%
AGENTS WERE SENT TO HIS HOME,

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:24.897 line:78%
AND HE FACES 11 YEARS IN PRISON

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:24.897 line:78%
FOR PROTECTING H

